@startuml i3-service-response-status
' The per-leg ServiceResponseStatus machine of docs/hld/70-i3-alignment.md §70.4.2 (D16, E5).
' One instance per DDSAssignment (one leg per notified service). Labels read:
' trigger [guard] / who may fire. Statuses carry the memo's Russian names (REQ-5281…5289).
' Every accepted transition appends one DDS_SERVICE_STATUS_SET and one history row.

skinparam state {
  BackgroundColor<<terminal>> #EEEEEE
  BackgroundColor<<primary>> #FFF6EF
}

title ServiceResponseStatus — one leg (DDSAssignment)

state "ADDED\nДобавлена" as ADDED
state "RECEIVED\nПолучена службой" as RECEIVED
state "ACCEPTED\nПринята" as ACCEPTED <<primary>>
state "NOT_ACCEPTED\nНе принята" as NOT_ACCEPTED <<primary>>
state "RESPONSE_STARTED\nНачало реагирования" as RESPONSE_STARTED
state "ARRIVED\nПрибытие" as ARRIVED
state "WORKING\nПроведение работ" as WORKING
state "COMPLETED\nРаботы завершены" as COMPLETED <<terminal>>
state "REFUSED\nОтказ от выполнения работ" as REFUSED <<terminal>>

[*] --> ADDED : leg created at HANDOFF_RECEIVED\n/ SIMULATION
ADDED --> RECEIVED : receive\n[DDS_CARD_OPENED, or first scripted step]\n/ SIMULATION
RECEIVED --> ACCEPTED : accept\n[guard_leg_actor_bound]\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION
RECEIVED --> NOT_ACCEPTED : decline\n[comment present; policy allows refusal]\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION
NOT_ACCEPTED --> ACCEPTED : accept\n(correction, REQ-5327)\n/ TRAINEE
ACCEPTED --> RESPONSE_STARTED : start_response\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION
RESPONSE_STARTED --> ARRIVED : arrive\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION
ARRIVED --> WORKING : start_work\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION
WORKING --> COMPLETED : complete\n/ TRAINEE, SIMULATION

ACCEPTED --> REFUSED : refuse\n[comment present; policy allows refusal]\n(also the correction of REQ-5328)
RESPONSE_STARTED --> REFUSED : refuse\n[comment present; policy allows refusal]
ARRIVED --> REFUSED : refuse\n[comment present; policy allows refusal]
WORKING --> REFUSED : refuse\n[comment present; policy allows refusal]

RECEIVED --> COMPLETED : complete_without_brigade\n[policy NO_REFUSAL (103)]
ACCEPTED --> COMPLETED : complete_without_brigade\n[policy NO_REFUSAL (103)]
RESPONSE_STARTED --> COMPLETED : complete_without_brigade\n[policy NO_REFUSAL (103)]
ARRIVED --> COMPLETED : complete_without_brigade\n[policy NO_REFUSAL (103)]
WORKING --> COMPLETED : complete_without_brigade\n[policy NO_REFUSAL (103)]

COMPLETED --> [*]
REFUSED --> [*]

note right of NOT_ACCEPTED
  Competence decision (always on, every dds_mode):
  «Не принята» needs a comment with the reason
  (422 COMMENT_REQUIRED otherwise, REQ-5284).
  Policy NO_REFUSAL (service 103) removes decline
  and refuse; complete_without_brigade replaces them
  (REQ-5290).
end note

note left of RECEIVED
  One step at a time (REQ-5293): the pencil dropdown
  offers only the legal next triggers. Any other
  status is 409 INVALID_TRANSITION (INV 8).
  «Номер наряда» (order_number) is free text on each
  entry; each entry is visible to every notified
  service (broadcast).
end note

note top of REFUSED
  Stage closure in memo mode: when every leg is COMPLETED,
  NOT_ACCEPTED or REFUSED, guard memo_all_legs_terminal holds and
  the ДДС may close (ACKNOWLEDGED --close--> RESOLVED --close--> CLOSED,
  i3-dds-stage-memo.puml).
end note

note bottom of COMPLETED
  RESOURCE_PICKER mode: the same statuses are mirrored
  by stage automation (source PICKER_MIRROR) from the
  leg's DDSStageState: RECEIVED→RECEIVED,
  ACKNOWLEDGED|RESOURCE_SELECTION|DISPATCHED→ACCEPTED,
  EN_ROUTE→RESPONSE_STARTED, ARRIVED→ARRIVED,
  WORKING→WORKING, RESOLVED→COMPLETED.
end note

@enduml
